Pako Engineers - Coupling Machining Tolerances

Couplings are manufactured for torque transmission between pump, motor, gearbox, and rotating equipment shafts.

Typical capability:
- Coupling types: rigid, spacer, flexible, gear, and custom drawing-based designs
- Outside diameter: up to 1000 mm
- Bore tolerance: H7 or customer specified
- Keyway: DIN, ISO, or custom profile
- Face and bore runout: controlled for vibration-sensitive assemblies
- Balancing: available for high-speed applications

Submit mating shaft dimensions, torque rating, keyway details, and operating speed for review.
